{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"世間てのは狭いものでねー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんの友達の友達がせっちゃん(宮澤成良chan)で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんの友達の妹の先輩があしゅ(齋藤飛鳥chan)なんとー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つ、つながったー＼(^O^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/11/2441572/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なかいさん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中元さんと伊藤さんね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういやまりか(伊藤万理華chan)に、ひめたんビームを伝授してーて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頼まれとったのに忘れてた!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかーごめんね('・・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日しよ。あした!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は撮影してきたのー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろんな衣装を着て撮りました。こんな着替えたのは久しぶりな気がするー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"詳細は追って発表されると思うから、お楽しみに(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そーしーて今日はダンスレッスンしてきましたー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近はイベントやテレビ用のダンスの練習ばっかだったけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は久々に基礎から。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ストレッチ、筋トレ、んでダンスねーっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱダンス好きよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"体の細かい動きとか表情とか見よったら、みんなちょっとずつ個性があって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お勉強になるよね(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またみなさんの前で踊りたいなーて思いまーしたっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと今週末の名古屋の練習もしてきた!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンケートありがと!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんはねー日によりけりだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たいてい朝はお米食べるかな(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お米はお腹にたまるからいいって聞いたことあるの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに最近体にいいからって玄米食べよるよ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ明日ひめたんの乃木坂浪漫オンエア!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よかったら見てくださいね(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の質問はなかなかハードです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いえすの人、何人おるかなー..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは明日の乃木坂浪漫で「家霊」ってお話を読んだんじゃけどー、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「家霊」のお話を知ってる人ー?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おるといいなあ(ω)☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/11/2441572/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誕生日は6/8よー!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/11/2441572/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誕生日は6月11日!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おめでとーうございます＼(^O^)／☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"２人近いね!６月ゆーたらかに座さーんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/11/2441572/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃんが広島の蟻が大きかったってブログに書いてるけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなに大きいの?w"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれくらいが普通の大きさよ(ω)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは、さゆにゃんが「アリおっきい」ってびっくりしてることに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"逆にびっくりー..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんれ。なんか複雑になってきた。黙ろうかな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/11/2441572/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまこちゃんと貝がらブラッコって誰?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/11/2441572/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまこちゃんと貝殻ブラッコちゃんって何?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/11/2441572/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『貝がらブラッコちゃん』って何?(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/11/2441572/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまこちゃんとかブラッコちゃんとは何かな?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/11/2441572/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまこちゃんと貝殻ブラッコって何~(・・?))ご当地キャラ??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまこちゃんとブラッコを知らないのかあ。そうだよね知らないよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ご当地ってわけじゃないけど、広島県民と愛媛県民しか知らないってゆー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのねー、広島ならホームテレビの天気予報のときに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまこちゃんやブラッコのアニメ？PV？が流れるの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまこちゃんはお料理してたり、ブラッコは踊ってたり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とにかく可愛いのよー(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうーあれだね。youtubeで調べるしか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/11/2441572/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんの御家族、御親戚、お友達も会場にたくさん来てくれたの?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/11/2441572/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"客席にひめたんのお母さんがいたっていってたけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ママさんも客席で見てたの?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぱぱ、おじいちゃん、おばあちゃん、親戚の方が来てくれた(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ままは東京の自宅でお土産のもみじまんじゅう待ってとったよ?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれー。何でままのこと見たんかね。ひめたんに内緒で瞬間移動..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いいや。きっと人違いです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/11/2441572/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「はしまき」ってなにそれ?美味しいの?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お好み焼きを箸で巻いたらはしまきの完成よ(^O^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"味はなんとなく想像できそうかしら。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"形はね、コンビニとかによく売ってるアメリカンドッグみたいになるー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/11/2441572/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんにお願いがあるのですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん写メを載せる時ピースで顔を隠すことが多いので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"顔を隠さないようにしてもらえないでしょうか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あらーそれは困った。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは顔にピースをすることでみなさんにビームを送ってたのですが..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んーたまにはピースなしビームも頑張って送ってみます(`・ω・')"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(*´・ω・*)ひめたん"}],"source":"archive"}